{"id":"nda345d3378","headline":"Muscat Stock Exchange hits highest level since 2008, crosses 8,000 mark","summary":"The Muscat Stock Exchange reached its highest level since 2008 and crossed the 8,000 mark. Market participants attributed the rally partly to strong corporate earnings of listed firms.","why":"The Muscat Stock Exchange is Oman's main securities market, and its index reflects the performance of major Omani listed companies. Oil-linked economies like Oman are sensitive to energy prices.","category":"markets","event_type":"other","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":true,"location":{"place":"Muscat","country":"Oman","lat":23.588,"lon":58.383,"region":"me"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"ZAWYA","url":"https://www.zawya.com/en/capital-markets/equities/muscat-stock-exchange-hits-highest-level-since-2008-crosses-8-000-mark-q7bjrpkm"},"sources":[{"name":"ZAWYA","url":"https://www.zawya.com/en/capital-markets/equities/muscat-stock-exchange-hits-highest-level-since-2008-crosses-8-000-mark-q7bjrpkm"}],"published_at":"2026-03-26T04:00:12Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T18:10:56Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"1851edea14419c7c","impacts":[],"why_moved":"Market participants believe the rally has been supported by strong corporate earnings from firms listed on the exchange.","backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T18:10:56Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-03-26T04:00:12Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-03-26T06:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"MU","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/stock-exchange-building-2463798.jpg","alt":"stock exchange building (illustration)","credit":"AhmadArdity","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/stock-tradi